{"seq":2,"slug":"stellar-physics","title":"恒星物理学","stage":"DONE","category":"astronomy-cosmology","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics","rating":{"composite":3.71,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"恒星物理学\">恒星物理学</h1><p>恒星物理学是天体物理学的核心分支，研究恒星的内部结构、能量产生机制、演化过程及终态。从分子云中的引力坍缩到最终的白矮星、中子星或黑洞，恒星的一生贯穿了核物理、流体力学、辐射转移和广义相对论等多个物理学领域。</p>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><p>本 Hub 按恒星生命周期的逻辑组织为四个章节：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>恒星结构与演化</strong> — 流体静力平衡、核聚变能源机制、赫罗图上的演化轨迹</li>\n<li><strong>恒星终态</strong> — 白矮星的电子简并、中子星与脉冲星、恒星级黑洞的形成</li>\n<li><strong>双星与变星</strong> — 双星系统的质量转移、变星分类与宇宙距离阶梯、新星与超新星物理</li>\n<li><strong>恒星形成</strong> — 分子云坍缩的金斯不稳定性、原恒星演化阶段、初始质量函数</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>基础经典力学与热力学</li>\n<li>原子核物理基础（结合能、隧穿效应）</li>\n<li>电磁辐射与光谱学基本概念</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"核心参考\">核心参考</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>资源</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Kippenhahn, Weigert &amp; Weiss《Stellar Structure and Evolution》</td>\n<td>恒星内部结构经典教材</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hansen, Kawaler &amp; Trimble《Stellar Interiors》</td>\n<td>侧重物理推导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shapiro &amp; Teukolsky《Black Holes, White Dwarfs, and Neutron Stars》</td>\n<td>致密天体物理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stahler &amp; Palla《The Formation of Stars》</td>\n<td>恒星形成标准参考</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stellar-structure-evolution","title":"恒星结构与演化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-structure-evolution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hydrostatic-equilibrium","title":"流体静力平衡与恒星结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-structure-evolution/hydrostatic-equilibrium"},{"seq":2,"slug":"nuclear-fusion-processes","title":"核聚变过程：pp链与CNO循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-structure-evolution/nuclear-fusion-processes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"stellar-evolution-tracks","title":"恒星演化轨迹：赫罗图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-structure-evolution/stellar-evolution-tracks"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"stellar-endpoints","title":"恒星终态","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-endpoints","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"white-dwarfs","title":"白矮星与电子简并","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-endpoints/white-dwarfs"},{"seq":2,"slug":"neutron-stars-pulsars","title":"中子星与脉冲星","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-endpoints/neutron-stars-pulsars"},{"seq":3,"slug":"black-hole-formation","title":"恒星级黑洞形成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/stellar-endpoints/black-hole-formation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"binary-variable-stars","title":"双星与变星","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/binary-variable-stars","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"binary-star-systems","title":"双星系统与质量转移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/binary-variable-stars/binary-star-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"variable-star-classes","title":"变星分类与测距","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/binary-variable-stars/variable-star-classes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"nova-supernova-physics","title":"新星与超新星物理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/binary-variable-stars/nova-supernova-physics"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"star-formation","title":"恒星形成","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/star-formation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"molecular-cloud-collapse","title":"分子云坍缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/star-formation/molecular-cloud-collapse"},{"seq":2,"slug":"protostellar-evolution","title":"原恒星演化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/star-formation/protostellar-evolution"},{"seq":3,"slug":"initial-mass-function","title":"初始质量函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/stellar-physics/star-formation/initial-mass-function"}]}]}